		"description": "<p>As your foe’s deadly attack falls upon you, your form becomes mist and shadow that is easily dispersed by the attack while you, in truth, are elsewhere. As a reaction to a successful melee attack, you teleport to a space within 50ft. You do not need line of sight to the space you choose, but if your teleport would place you inside a solid object such as a wall you instead take 4d6 damage and appear outside the object in an adjacent square within 50ft. If your teleport would place you inside a creature, both you and the creature take 1d10 force damage and you appear in a square adjacent to the creature.</p>",
